  "question": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\qt0066_7e364a9c6b72.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.65in;height:0.85833in\" /><br />\rFind the sum of bond order between same bonded atoms in Q and R compounds."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3.00",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0066_67c715f95b4d.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:3.54167in;height:1.16667in\" /><br />Bond order of <math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>]</mo></math> in <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1.0</mn></math><br />Bond order of <math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>]</mo></math> in <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn></math><br />So sum of bond order between same bonded atoms in Q and R compounds = 1 + 2.0 = 3.0."
  }
}